# --- Kaitai Struct specs, and the parser generated from them -------------
# Vendored unmodified from Deep-Symmetry/crate-digger, so no headers: the
# files must stay comparable to upstream.
#
# PROVISIONAL. The .ksy files declare "license: EPL-1.0" in their own meta:
# block while crate-digger's LICENSE is EPL-2.0 with Secondary Licenses of
# MPL-2.0 or LGPL-3.0. The LICENSE file is taken as authoritative and the
# meta: field as stale -- reported upstream as
# https://github.com/Deep-Symmetry/crate-digger/issues/49.
#
# Whether the generated parser is a derivative of the specs, and whether the
# secondary-licence election reaches it, is asked in
# https://github.com/Deep-Symmetry/crate-digger/issues/50. If the election
# does reach it, this becomes "EPL-2.0 OR MPL-2.0 OR LGPL-3.0-only" and
# Seabass elects LGPL-3.0, which is what makes it combinable with the GPL.
# Revisit both entries when that issue is answered.
Files: specs/rekordbox_pdb.ksy
 specs/rekordbox_anlz.ksy
 src/infrastructure/rekordbox/generated/*
Copyright: Deep Symmetry, LLC and the crate-digger contributors
License: EPL-2.0

